  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Dominican Republic - Banking and Financial Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intermittent banking advisors are providing technical assistance to the Central Bank in the areas of financial inclusion and financial stability. In addition, they are assisting with the creation of a Real Estate Price Index to provide more transparency into the real estate market and to help identify potential market booms/busts. Further assistance is being provided in assessing the current legal framework on secured transactions, including features and state of development of the mobile collateral registry.</narrative>
  </description>
